lentlessly from the front, back, sides, and even above.\nStay calm, move fast, and aim for high scores and combos!\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "AppIcon_512x512.png", "id": "1963167287862669", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619187_1963167291196002_8623706016118764924_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RRQGZGDEAj8Q7kNvwF5HMth&_nc_oc=AdqzEAWyggBV_dPuGMNHAFDCWNQRF2HxHbJ6XZGuYnmXtVxzmyS0U5Oqj1dO61kbkTQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQK5rJYSRbgUSXh9FGH22sxXwJUqjF3lKPGZIiXzNzf0CA&oe=6AA2A691"}, {"file_name": "Cover_landscape.png", "id": "1414701440178062", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618277_1414701443511395_2798405465944603676_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AXKp6Id-iUsQ7kNvwFnrqkx&_nc_oc=AdrmavxdDM48CYGazvHAaOTUpMZohJUy1lvsbHjTt_q0xIMg6SRhpMObn5hVe515KXo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLZ9SuRMDsJuvP3W_62YCtfoZbctrlP53LrDktbuXo8FA&oe=6AA29E26"}, {"file_name": "HeroCover.png", "id": "1291863762221604", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618484_1291863765554937_9147686361582286101_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pvBNR5AmddkQ7kNvwGXKmSq&_nc_oc=AdoJshhYRcHBo44VnMUCQrg_9IZpH_WaELVf10jwtAut5VOBbpTRY5GG5K9JgyknvPw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIMj0LDSi98AAZVOgXkFCiXaqbRHk9i67UEwOzeEHWFnw&oe=6AA2B5E4"}, {"file_name": "Logo.png", "id": "1148963270414958", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308222_1148963273748291_7733004916691207047_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LY1c-NepUY0Q7kNvwF-vTs1&_nc_oc=AdovCif7y3aWNE0zMfq6zKho9mdwTpnOlytSUbFNjiloXVQhbAPFNpp1m0Km7B1kBPc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKdQL-51ezK6O